{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "ae8c8afcfa36cecacb166e6c61accbadb12ecbf58fac206445141092a59cfde0", "ja": "あー、あー。……アテンションプリーズ！\nアテンションプリーズ？　うーん、こんな感じかなぁ。", "zh": "啊——啊——……请注意！\n请注意？嗯……大概是这种感觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1001_p", "source_sha256": "644d81da54f77d7ee572a1544a5f18f9adf2dd9272433f68de0cac40ba0ed216", "ja": "お疲れさま、春香。\n衣装の具合はどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，春香。\n服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "5da856d94a0a906c7f80722e134fdcafba4e9dbe2febd4e4c180edb9c3a90be0", "ja": "ひゃあっ、{$P$}さん！？\nい、いつからそこにいたんですか！？", "zh": "呀啊，{$P$}先生！？\n你、你什么时候在那里的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a66ad817b8f8534ef6e881fcb459c6a8bf79e57d822aee3e11880eb10fe0b50e", "ja": "いま来たところだよ。ずいぶんと楽しそうに\nしてたから、声をかけるか迷ったけど。", "zh": "我刚到。看你好像很开心的\n样子，还在犹豫要不要叫你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "d4b1558e5b1a9bda4ed7585a5659fe1167b04e0f30e131a75b394ea8b388d5d1", "ja": "あ……。聞かれてたんですね、いまのひとりごと。\nううっ、恥ずかしいなぁ……。", "zh": "啊……刚才的自言自语，被听到了呀。\n呜呜，好难为情啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "adb2ed380945b0783566e5b9166ee2ca955e008113dae9917cf33293b260f8ee", "ja": "はは、立派なCAさんっぷりだったよ。\n衣装も相まって、よりイメージが湧いたな。", "zh": "哈哈，真是很有空乘小姐的样子。\n再加上服装，我就更能想象出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "b2fddf22eface8e4ea7ebcd2ab89f443be81c836fa4749c3fb6edc9de361b65b", "ja": "えへへ……♪　今回、CAさんの制服が\n衣装のモチーフになってるって聞いて、つい。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪听说这次的服装是以空乘制服为设计主题，就忍不住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "a5325400316d41d97d50283345f824871336842829708dfdb2c775823409d656", "ja": "それに、髪もかわいくアレンジしてもらったんです！\n嬉しくなって、ちょっとだけ真似しちゃいました♪", "zh": "而且，头发也让人帮忙做了可爱的造型！\n一高兴起来，就忍不住稍微模仿了一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1008_p", "source_sha256": "aa977682e1b9f9a960a5840dbf93abd1ccb905da63fa96e40f2af7f4a926a790", "ja": "それは何よりだ。改めて、\n春香にとてもよく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "那就太好了。再次一看，我觉得这发型真的很适合春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0dfcb36fd1e11ca78eee091f43d910951473952367c31bb61a8563b45f82cb10", "ja": "うん、せっかくだし、もうちょっと\n続けてみたらどうだ？　CAさんのアナウンス。", "zh": "嗯，难得有这个机会，要不要再\n继续播一下？空姐的机舱广播。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "dbe7e206e0c1ead2d3eb4555dc5c8a936e4f39e0905e2f1b954f4e1b7df385cf", "ja": "ええっ？　改めてですか？\nそう言われると、すこし恥ずかしいですけど……。", "zh": "诶？还要再来一遍吗？\n你这么一说，倒是让我有点害羞了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "ca4361950daf42694c9803deffae79d28b79cc24fabcbfa739b9ea82d3abb6b9", "ja": "では……こほん。「ご搭乗のみなさま、本日はミリオン\n航空をご利用いただき、誠にありがとうございます」", "zh": "那么……咳咳。“各位乘客，感谢您今天乘坐百万航空，衷心感谢”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "eaa7e7beb709b8fbd87cd44953a083c7f1060f6c2301a69a2ba0aae0b938eb62", "ja": "どうぞ、快適な空の旅をお過ごしくだしゃっ……！」\nぐっ……し、舌、噛んりゃいまひた……。", "zh": "请尽情享受舒适的空中旅程……！\n呜……我、我咬到舌头了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8071c99d16430552994792ec358a4549e02fec176030a4fe49f9136911ef2023", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か？", "zh": "没、没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "8949dd70e74e3f5c1d98d01372ae850559e9738e9865cc6c9c0623c42ef268d6", "ja": "うぅ……大丈夫れす……。あ。あ。うん、オーケー。\nはぁ。本物のCAさんには、ほど遠いですね。", "zh": "呜呜……我没呲……啊。啊。嗯，没问题了。\n唉。距离真正的空姐，还差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0a275d4b4624b0538fbf21b2b0f7f07773d771264663eb6334a91a210e23658e", "ja": "いいや。無理に本物のCAさんに近づこうとする\n必要は無いんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不必勉强自己去接近真正的空乘人员吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "40a47fb4e5810e385484cdf5f5625d8133b71395c9323f919745ae55f36d4673", "ja": "大事なのは、お客さんに喜んでもらうこと。\nアイドルと一緒だよ。春香なりのやり方でいい。", "zh": "重要的是让客人开心。\n这和当偶像是一样的。用春香你自己的方式去做就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "dae42d255baee26ddc36dbb836aaace10bac46fe63230a1a6b580a0215b0f0f0", "ja": "あっ、確かにそうですね！　でも、\n私なりのやり方かぁ……。それなら……歌、とか？", "zh": "啊，确实是这样呢！不过，\n用我自己的方式啊……那……唱歌，之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bc8ed520afac83a7994b6d65f88fb49b0618ca314cbaf6a0e54f3aff2111168e", "ja": "歌うCAさん……いいじゃないか！\n大人から子どもまで、幅広く喜んでもらえそうだな。", "zh": "会唱歌的空姐……不错嘛！\n感觉从大人到孩子，大家都会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "4dfec4e232e2c0e33c244945e5e1261b7b786f94327fea021aa867ae15f5dc8d", "ja": "歌うCAさん……！　なんだか楽しそうですね。\n搭乗アナウンスを歌いながら、とか♪", "zh": "会唱歌的空姐……！感觉好像会很有趣呢。\n一边唱着登机广播什么的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0264_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "14e9a14727acb7a589b7ec4be6aa1582de0493fb5a926119342a2a27e1a56a31", "ja": "アテンションプリ～ズ♪　みたいな感じで！\nそれなら私らしさも出せそうです。えへへっ♪", "zh": "就像“请注意——♪”那样！\n这样一来，应该也能展现出我的风格。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
